# GitHub 发布范围：根目录默认排除，仅开放正式项目和必要说明。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/endpoint_routing_strategy/
!/endpoint_routing_strategy/docs/2026.10.06进展——pareto前沿.md
!/model_gateway/实验数据/

# 原始数据、产物、旧实验、归档与历史资料仅本地保留。
/endpoint_routing_strategy/experiments/legacy/
/endpoint_routing_strategy/experiments/archive/
/endpoint_routing_strategy/experiments/output/
/endpoint_routing_strategy/docs/*.png

# 本机配置和凭据。
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
endpoint_routing_strategy/experiments/output/
endpoint_routing_strategy/experiments/archive/*.zip
.tmp_strategy_render/
